    "title": "Weezer-Lite, MP3 Music player",
    "description": "Weezer-Lite, Listen to your favorite songs and Play anywhere! Play OFFLINE, UNLIMITS!\r\nWhether you're driving, flying, or doing housework, the Music NO-Stop!!\r\n\r\nWeezer-Lite is an advanced & fast mp3 player for android devices that has an elegant design and good sound quality to play your favorite music and soundtracks from all the music files with custom playlist in this audio player. \r\n\r\n - While using other apps, you can play music in the background for free with all audio files\r\n - Create a favorite playlist. \r\n - One tap to play offline music.\r\n - Music import, you can import any music or video you want from Photos, Files, Wifi, and you can listen to it offline.\r\n - Popular formats are all supported.\r\n - Control through Headphone.\r\n - As powerful as your wish\r\n\r\nNow download it and enjoy!",
